<style>
  :root {
    --font-family: "<%= (session && session.fontStyle ? String(session.fontStyle).trim() : 'Inter') %>", sans-serif;
    --primary: #01535b;
    --primary-light: #e8f4f5;
    --border: #e5e7eb;
    --text: #1f2937;
    --text-muted: #6b7280;
    --bg: #f9fafb;
  }

  body {
    font-family: var(--font-family);
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 0;
    background-color: var(--bg);
    line-height: 1.7;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }

  main {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .page-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .page-header h1 {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .page-header p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .about-section {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 28px 28px 24px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .about-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .about-section p {
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .about-section p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .about-section ul {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .about-section li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .about-section li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 8px;
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--primary);
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .cta-card {
    background: var(--primary);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 32px 28px;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .cta-card h3 {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .cta-card p {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .cta-card a {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 10px 28px;
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--primary);
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }

  .cta-card a:hover { opacity: 0.9; }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    main { padding: 100px 20px 60px; }
    .page-header { margin: 20px 12px 40px; }
    .page-header h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
    .about-section { padding: 20px 18px; margin: 0 12px 24px; }
    .cta-card { padding: 24px 20px; margin: 0 12px 40px; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    main { padding: 110px 16px 50px; }
    .page-header { margin: 30px 8px 40px; }
    .page-header h1 { font-size: 1.35rem; }
    .page-header p { font-size: 0.88rem; }
    .about-section { padding: 16px 14px; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 8px 24px; }
    .about-section h2 { font-size: 1.02rem; }
    .about-section p { font-size: 0.92rem; }
    .about-section li { font-size: 0.9rem; padding-left: 20px; }
    .cta-card { padding: 20px 16px; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 8px 40px; }
    .cta-card h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; }
    .cta-card p { font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .cta-card a { padding: 10px 22px; font-size: 0.88rem; }
  }
</style>
  
<main>
  <div class="page-header">
    <h1>About Managira</h1>
    <p>The next-generation school management platform — built to help educational institutions of every size work smarter, not harder.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="about-section">
    <h2>Our Story</h2>
    <p>Managira is a product of scREAte Ltd., created with one goal in mind: to simplify how schools operate. From student enrollment to academic tracking and beyond, our all-in-one platform empowers educational institutions to streamline operations, reduce paperwork, enhance communication, and focus on what truly matters — delivering exceptional education.</p>
    <p>We serve individual schools, private institutions, government education departments, and school districts that need a reliable, modern solution for managing their academic operations.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="about-section">
    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <p>We believe technology should simplify the educational experience, not complicate it. Our mission is to provide schools, colleges, and educational bodies with a single, powerful platform that removes administrative burdens, connects students, teachers, parents, and administrators, and enables data-driven decision making — all in one smooth workflow.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="about-section">
    <h2>What Makes Managira Different</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Comprehensive Management</strong> — We go beyond basic student information systems, offering tools that handle enrollment, attendance, academic reporting, assessments, grade management, and more.</li>
      <li><strong>Hub System for Multi-School Oversight</strong> — Government institutions and educational bodies can oversee multiple schools from a single Hub dashboard, monitoring performance and coordinating across their entire network.</li>
      <li><strong>Real-Time Data & Insights</strong> — Our analytics dashboard gives leaders the power to monitor performance, track trends, and make informed decisions instantly.</li>
      <li><strong>Designed for Mobility</strong> — Whether on desktop, tablet, or phone, you can access your school's data anytime, anywhere.</li>
      <li><strong>Parent & Guardian Portal</strong> — Parents stay connected to their child's progress with real-time access to grades, attendance, and school updates.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="about-section">
    <h2>Core Features</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Student Information Management</strong> — Complete student profiles with academic history, personal details, and guardian information.</li>
      <li><strong>Enrollment & Admissions</strong> — Streamlined online application processing with public enrollment forms and automated workflows.</li>
      <li><strong>Attendance Tracking</strong> — Real-time attendance monitoring for accurate and reliable record-keeping.</li>
      <li><strong>Grade & Assessment Management</strong> — Digital gradebooks, test creation, and performance analytics.</li>
      <li><strong>Report Generation</strong> — Professional report cards, merit sheets, and academic transcripts generated automatically.</li>
      <li><strong>Parent Portal & Public Website</strong> — Give parents a live view of school updates and their child's progress, while your public-facing website helps the community learn about your institution.</li>
      <li><strong>Hub Management</strong> — Centralised oversight for government bodies and organisations managing multiple schools.</li>
      <li><strong>Customisable Branding</strong> — Upload your logo, set your colours, and make the platform your own.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="about-section">
    <h2>Who We Serve</h2>
    <p>Managira is built for educational institutions of every size and type:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Primary & Secondary Schools</strong> — Complete K–12 management solutions.</li>
      <li><strong>Colleges & Universities</strong> — Advanced tools for higher education.</li>
      <li><strong>Government Education Departments</strong> — Hub-based systems for overseeing multiple institutions across regions.</li>
      <li><strong>School Districts</strong> — Centralised management for networks of schools.</li>
      <li><strong>Private Schools & Academies</strong> — Tailored solutions for independent learning environments.</li>
      <li><strong>Training Centres</strong> — Specialised features for vocational and professional education.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="about-section">
    <h2>Why Choose Managira?</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Proven Reliability</strong> — Built on secure, scalable infrastructure with 99.9% uptime.</li>
      <li><strong>Quick Setup</strong> — Get started in about 15 minutes with an intuitive interface and smooth onboarding.</li>
      <li><strong>Dedicated Support</strong> — Ongoing assistance, documentation, video tutorials, and platform improvements.</li>
      <li><strong>Cost-Effective</strong> — Professional-grade tools at prices that work for schools of all sizes.</li>
      <li><strong>Scalable</strong> — From a single classroom to a network of institutions, Managira grows with you.</li>
      <li><strong>Secure & Compliant</strong> — Enterprise-grade encryption, GDPR and FERPA compliance, and role-based access controls.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="cta-card">
    <h3>Transform your school's management today</h3>
    <p>Join the growing number of institutions that trust Managira to simplify operations and elevate the learning experience.</p>
    <a href="/account/register">Start Your Free Trial</a>
  </div>
</main>

